    "notes": "The period is classified as regressing because the back strength index dropped from 101 to 96, a decline of 5 points, which exceeds the 3-point threshold for a regression verdict. This is the primary driver of the overall status. On the positive side, the chest index rose from 106 to 112, a gain of 6 points, which is excellent and directly supports the long-term goal of a 100 kg bench press. Triceps also improved from 105 to 108, a 3-point rise, complementing the chest progress well. Shoulders, biceps, and legs all held perfectly steady at their previous levels, showing no loss or gain. The back decline is the one item that needs attention and should be monitored closely next period.",
